Logical: KGPublication
Parent: DublinCore
Title: "Knowledge graph L1: Publication"
Description: "A WHO publication: a guideline of any of the handbook's types, a position paper, a summary table, a classification, implementation guidance, or a supplement. Metadata follows Dublin Core. identifiers is a list of {type, value}; type is from identifier-type, and the first of isbn, iris-handle, doi, issn, url builds the IRI, so an edition change is a new publication. issued and modified are Dublin Core. reviewBy is the handbook's review-by date (§12.5.1). sha256 pins the PDF. Derives from DublinCore (smart-base input/fsh/models/DublinCore.fsh); title, creator, publisher, language, rights are its elements. Class IRI: http://smart.who.int/kg/publication."

* ^status = #active
* ^publisher = "World Health Organization (WHO)"
* issued 0..1 date "Issued" "Dublin Core dcterms:issued — date of formal issuance (YYYY, YYYY-MM or YYYY-MM-DD)."
* modified 0..1 date "Modified" "Dublin Core dcterms:modified — date the publication was changed."
* version 0..1 string "Version" "Edition or version, as printed."
* identifiers 0..* BackboneElement "Identifiers" "Typed identifiers; the first of isbn, iris-handle, doi, issn, url builds the IRI."
  * type 0..1 code "Type" "The identifier's kind."
  * type from KGIdentifierTypeVS (required)
  * value 0..1 string "Value" "The identifier, as printed."
* url 0..1 uri "URL" "Where the publication is published."
* sha256 0..1 string "SHA-256" "Hash of the PDF; pins the source."
* publicationType 0..1 code "Publication type" "What kind of publication this is."
* publicationType from KGPublicationTypeVS (required)
* grcStatus 0..1 code "Grc status" "Whether the Guideline Review Committee approved the publication."
* grcStatus from KGGrcStatusVS (required)
* reviewBy 0..1 date "Review by" "The handbook's review-by date (§12.5.1)."

