* heading 0..1 string "Heading" "The section heading, verbatim."
* number 0..1 string "Number" "The section number as printed (\"1.2\", \"Annex 3\")."
* pageRange 0..1 string "Page range" "Pages the section occupies, as printed or physical (\"12-18\")."
* ordinal 0..1 unsignedInt "Ordinal" "Position among its siblings."

Logical: KGPublicationElement
Title: "Knowledge graph L1: Publication element"
Description: "One printed block: a table, a table row, a footnote, a figure, a chart, an image, a flowchart, a box or a list. It records where something is printed and exactly what is printed that no content node holds. It carries no meaning of its own; meaning lives in content nodes, joined by presentedIn. columns is the header text, verbatim. columnMap names, per column, the content field that fills it when the table is re-rendered (e.g. 'Recommendation' -> statement). cells holds only text no content node holds; a cell filled through columnMap is null. text is for unmodelled printed text such as a footnote that is not a remark. sha256 is for images. Class IRI: http://smart.who.int/kg/publication-element."

* ^status = #active
* ^publisher = "World Health Organization (WHO)"
* elementType 0..1 code "Element type" "What kind of printed block a publication element is."
* elementType from KGElementTypeVS (required)
* label 0..1 string "Label" "The element's printed label (\"Table 3\", \"Box 2\")."
* caption 0..1 markdown "Caption" "The element's caption, verbatim."
* pageRange 0..1 string "Page range" "Pages the element is printed on."
* ordinal 0..1 unsignedInt "Ordinal" "Position among its siblings."
* rowType 0..1 code "Row type" "The role of a row within a table."
* rowType from KGRowTypeVS (required)
* columns 0..* string "Columns" "The header text, verbatim, one per column; a blank header is an empty string."
* columnMap 0..* BackboneElement "Column map" "Per column, the content field that fills it when the table is re-rendered (e.g. 'Recommendation' -> statement)."
  * column 0..1 string "column" "The column."
  * field 0..1 string "field" "The field."
* cells 0..* string "Cells" "Text no content node holds, per column; a cell filled through columnMap is null."
* text 0..1 markdown "Text" "Unmodelled printed text, such as a footnote that is not a remark."
* sha256 0..1 string "SHA-256" "Hash of the image, for an image element."

Logical: KGRecommendation
Title: "Knowledge graph L1: Recommendation"
Description: "A normative statement from a WHO guideline. Kinds other than a graded recommendation (context-specific, research-only, good practice statement, no-recommendation) are the same node with a different kind. statement is verbatim and is the only stored copy. intervention, population, setting, provider and timing are verbatim slots taken from the statement, its remarks, or the enclosing caption or heading. setting absorbs the former conditionality. identifier is the published number (e.g. A.1.1), used in the IRI; sub-recommendations append their letter. Class IRI: http://smart.who.int/kg/recommendation."

* ^status = #active
* ^publisher = "World Health Organization (WHO)"
* identifier 0..1 string "Identifier" "The published number (e.g. A.1.1); sub-recommendations append their letter."
* statement 0..1 markdown "Statement" "The recommendation, VERBATIM; the only stored copy."
* kind 0..1 code "Kind" "What sort of normative statement this is."
* kind from KGRecommendationKindVS (required)
* direction 0..1 code "Direction" "For or against."
* direction from KGRecommendationDirectionVS (required)
* strength 0..1 code "Strength" "GRADE strength."
* strength from KGRecommendationStrengthVS (required)
* overallCertainty 0..1 code "Overall certainty" "GRADE certainty of evidence."
* overallCertainty from KGCertaintyVS (required)
* justification 0..1 markdown "Justification" "The printed justification, verbatim."
* status 0..1 code "Status" "Whether a recommendation is still in force."
* status from KGRecommendationStatusVS (required)
* changeStatus 0..1 code "Change status" "Whether this edition of a consolidated guideline introduces, updates or carries a recommendation or indicator unchanged."
* changeStatus from KGChangeStatusVS (required)
* intervention 0..1 string "Intervention" "Verbatim slot: the intervention, quoted from the statement, a remark, caption or heading."
* interventionType 0..1 code "Intervention type" "DRAFT."
* interventionType from KGInterventionTypeVS (required)
* population 0..1 string "Population" "Verbatim slot: the population."
* setting 0..1 string "Setting" "Verbatim slot: the setting (absorbs the former conditionality)."
* provider 0..1 string "Provider" "Verbatim slot: who provides it."
* timing 0..1 string "Timing" "Verbatim slot: when."
* contentHash 0..1 string "Content hash" "sha256 of the normalised statement; unchanged on re-extraction means current."

