* numerator 0..1 markdown "Numerator" "Numerator, verbatim."
* denominator 0..1 markdown "Denominator" "Denominator, verbatim."
* variants 0..* BackboneElement "Variants" "Population- or level-specific forms (PRV.17, PRV.3)."
